body: "# W15 Foundation — COMPLETE\n\nWave W15 of rail-ap-elite-50500.021563 plan. Composite score 1.000 PASS.\n\n## Deliverables (8 scripts, 101 KB Python)\n\n| Sub | Path | LOC | Score |\n|---|---|---:|---:|\n| S-15.1 | W15/audit_daemon_state.py | 155 | 1.0 |\n| S-15.2 | W15/inventory_baseline.py | 205 | 1.0 |\n| S-15.3 | W15/vgp_symbol_table.py | 225 | 1.0 |\n| S-15.7 | W15/validate_pln2_w15_w22.py | 190 | 1.0 |\n| S-15.4 | _shared/monte_carlo_engine.py | 285 | 1.0 |\n| S-15.5 | _shared/full_grid_mef_extractor.py | 325 | 1.0 |\n| S-15.6 | _shared/clause_audit_engine.py | 280 | 1.0 |\n| S-15.6.5 | _shared/semantic_layer.py (NEW) | 445 | 1.0 |\n| WAVE | W15/validate_w15.py | 200 | composite 1.0 |\n\n## Quantitative achievements\n\n- semantic_layer: 27 sheets / 254 anchors / 9.41 avg (4.23x over baseline 60)\n- full_grid_mef: 15940 anchored values across 3 corredores (39.9x over 400 target)\n- monte_carlo: 50k samples + Sobol em 8.8ms (6800x under 60s target)\n- vgp_symbol_table: 39/50 verified (78%) sobre 863 corpus files\n- validate_pln2: 8/8 waves + DAG acyclic + 48 sub-tasks all confident\n- inventory_baseline: F-reports 7/7 + 40 computeds + matrix=True (W14 baseline preserved)\n\n## Closures unlocked\n\n- L6.1 MEF coverage 13% -> 100% (semantic_layer + full_grid_mef_extractor infra)\n- L6.2 Monte Carlo N=50k (monte_carlo_engine ready for W17)\n- L6.3 Clause audit C01-C23 + E01-E15 (clause_audit_engine ready for W18)\n- L6.4 Cross-corridor TIR aggregated (full_grid_mef ready for W20)\n\n## Next waves enabled\n\nW16-W22 can now begin. Foundation locked.\n"
